WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:20.000
Actual emulator recording, build 141. Read the prominent disclosure.
Reject, reopen, then explicitly accept. Consent alone starts no automation.

00:20.000 --> 00:25.000
Open the publicly available offline demo. All community names,
house numbers, people and receipt numbers are fictional.

00:25.000 --> 00:36.000
Android accessibility settings: explicitly enable Manager Assistant.
This permission allows screen reading and user-started deterministic actions.

00:36.000 --> 00:49.000
Actual on-device OCR reads the synthetic label. Review and edit its result.
Sample: fictional community, house 903, floor 7, name 陳小雲. No actual barcode.

00:49.000 --> 01:40.000
The shared registration engine observes and operates the bundled demo form.
NOT SmartLife: no production records, remote submission or print jobs.

01:40.000 --> 01:53.700
Local demo success: reference 90001, fictional house 903, floor 7.
One submission. The engine reads the result and stops.
